{"id":"vod_zy360_57133","vodId":"57133","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"葬送的芙莉莲","name_cn":"葬送的芙莉莲","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全28集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20240419-1/236a9c31663385fc2fe35b57e582f276.jpg"},"summary":"　　中央大陆古老城邦，人们夹道欢呼，为击败了魔王的四人组高声喝彩。这四个人分别是勇者辛美尔（冈本信彦配音）、精灵魔导师芙莉莲（种崎敦美配音）、僧侣海塔（东地宏树配音）以及矮人族战士艾泽（上田耀司配音）。在王宫盛大的晚宴上，四位好朋友相聊甚欢，并且共同回忆着征途中的快乐种种。当天上流星划过，他们相约去一个更好的地方欣赏这个五十年一遇的流星雨。在此之后，芙莉莲告别好友们，独自踏上收集魔法的旅程。时光倏忽而逝，转眼五十年过去，她如约回到主城。而与这个几乎拥有不死之身且不会衰老的精灵形成鲜明对比的是，曾经英俊帅气、孔武有力的朋友们都已经衰老。他们追昔过往，又无奈面对死亡。这让芙莉莲的心中产生了波动……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,奇幻,冒险,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-02-08 21:02:55","episodeCount":28,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250202/CaIhei8G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250205/vOSWt07D/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250207/ok600iSf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/reVosycz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/n7OcKUXS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/TSAR0qd9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/gz8E1qNZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/TN4S68nt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/VY54d7ne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/fatfTwkW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/mfHSDWKn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/OR1rQz8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/xgABz0dV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/OiYRo8j8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/202502